      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "旅人にひと時の憩いと寝床を提供する場所……\nそれが、我らがバスク宿場町さ！\n今回、それに加えて、元気の出る舞でもてなしたい。\n客がわんさと押し寄せる、素敵な舞台を頼むぜ！",
        "official_en": "Here at Barsk Post Town, we strive to give every\ntraveler a good meal and a warm bed. And now,\nwe'd like to add a dancer to our accommodations.\nGive us a dance to draw a crowd!",
        "real_en": "Here at Basque Post Town, we strive to give every\ntraveler a good meal and a warm bed. And now,\nwe'd like to add a dancer to our accommodations.\nGive us a dance to draw a crowd!"
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
    },
