      },
      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "いやいや、あんた、実にたいしたもんだね！\nお客は大盛り上がり！　酒場は大繁盛！\n酔い潰れた客で、宿も満床ってありさまだ！\n定期的に来てくんないかな……考えといてよ！",
        "official_en": "My, you really are something! That drove the crowd\ntotally wild. The tavern was thriving, the inn was\npacked with drunk guests—would you consider\ndropping by regularly? Think on it!",
